@startuml UserStartsNewChapter
' --- DIAGRAM METADATA ---
title "Sequence Diagram: User Starts a New Chapter Contribution"

' --- PARTICIPANTS ---
actor User
participant "Frontend (Next.js)" as Frontend

' --- INITIAL STATE ---
ref over User, Frontend: User is on the Subject Detail page and authenticated.

' --- FLOW OF EVENTS ---
User -> Frontend: Clicks "Add Content" button
activate Frontend
Frontend --> User: Opens "AddContentModal.tsx"

User -> Frontend: Clicks the "Suggest new chapter" button/select option
note right of Frontend: The button contains a link to the contribution page.

Frontend -> Frontend: Navigates to route '/contribute/new-chapter/{subjectId}'

Frontend --> User: Renders the dedicated New Chapter Editor page.
deactivate Frontend
note over User, Frontend: The user is now on a new page with a form for Chapter Title and a rich text editor for the content.

' --- LINK TO NEXT JOURNEY ---
ref over User, Frontend: The process of actually *submitting* the new chapter will be detailed in a separate diagram.

@enduml